- battery life for handportables operating in direct mode shall be a minimum of 8
hours based on the following cycle:
- 20% transmit;
- 20% receive;
- 60% stand-by;
- when direct mode is used as a fall-back, an audible and visual indication shall be
provided of normal mobile telephony services returning.
